WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.334 --> 00:00:03.189
打开 Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.189 --> 00:00:06.087
新建规则 / Create a Rule

3
00:00:06.087 --> 00:00:08.939
命名 Guide test header / Name the Rule

4
00:00:08.939 --> 00:00:11.789
限制 Host 为 127.0.0.1 / Restrict the host

5
00:00:11.789 --> 00:00:14.991
添加 Path 条件 / Add a Path matcher

6
00:00:14.991 --> 00:00:17.798
填写 /guide/rules/order / Enter the test path

7
00:00:17.798 --> 00:00:20.587
填写 x-interceptor-guide / Enter the header name

8
00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:23.388
填写 rules-demo / Enter the header value

9
00:00:23.388 --> 00:00:26.195
启用规则 / Enable the Rule

10
00:00:26.195 --> 00:00:29.037
应用规则 / Apply the Rule

11
00:00:29.037 --> 00:00:33.695
发送匹配请求 / Send a matching request

12
00:00:33.695 --> 00:00:36.839
在 Capture 核对实际结果 / Inspect the actual Capture result

13
00:00:36.839 --> 00:00:39.837
核对非匹配请求不受影响 / Verify an unmatched request

14
00:00:39.837 --> 00:00:42.839
停用规则并 Apply / Disable and Apply
